  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "description": "Boundary wall along A306 - T1-T18 Lawson Cypress, T19 and T20 self set Elder Berry - Fell. Reason: There is a wall from the Kings head public house which these tree run along and act as screening from viewing the main road. There is a drop of approx. 10 feet from public house garden and footpath. The root systems of these trees are causing damage and cracking to the wall and fear of failure is a concern. The trees in place are to my knowledge between 15-18 years old and damage to the wall is clearly visible and there is a high target area if the wall was to go, as there is a footpath and busy main road within falling distance.",
